m/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/roszwccs1m4zvlisezcx.jpg"}, {"id": 99014, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/c5zlvf2fwcwka9j2fxt6.jpg"}], "slug": "world-of-guns-gun-disassembly", "summary": "Do you know how the insides of a Terminator\u2019s Minigun work? Try World of Guns: the world\u2019s most realistic 3D simulator of firearms (and other things from tanks to DeLorean time machines). Find out what makes legendary pistols, rifles, machine guns and artillery pieces tick\u2026 Then disassemble them down to the tiniest part!\n\nA free-to-play game and an interactive encyclopedia, simulating real firearms in 3D. Here, you can literally climb inside a gun and understand its workings; cut it in half, fire it and bring time to a crawl; and finally, completely disassemble it and put it back again (against the clock if you wish).\n\nWoG meticulously recreates historical and modern examples of firearm designer genius \u2014 from a tiny Liberator pistol to a 16000-pound FlaK 88 anti-aircraft gun. It has both legendary World War guns and rare models that even museums struggle to find. World of Guns puts 200 years of firearm history into a single, sleek and engaging video game.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/world-of-guns-gun-disassembly", "videos": [{"id": 7275, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "oKFC4HjRSFg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oKFC4HjRSFg", "title": "World of Guns:Gun Disassembly video trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oKFC4HjRSFg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 42174, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "BlFTsGOdfM8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BlFTsGOdfM8", "title": "Lets Play World of Guns: Gun Disassembly 77 - Dragunov Sniper Rifle (SVD)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BlFTsGOdfM8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 188270, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "e60PHq3CaNM", "url": "http